# --- build output ---
node_modules/
out/
dist/
*.vsix
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- the Mindustry-C compiler ---
# `compiler/` is its own git repository (upstream: mindustry-c) and keeps its
# own history. It is a *build input* of this extension, not part of it: the
# extension bundles it with esbuild and applies the patches in `patches/`.
# See docs/COMPILER-INTEGRATION.md.
/compiler/

# Nothing in compiler/ is generated here; the bundle lands in dist/.

# --- scratch ---
# `probe.mts` is a per-session scratch file for scripts/probe.mjs: write a
# question about the compiler's AST there, run it, throw it away. Keeping it
# out of the repository stops a throwaway dump from becoming a stale fixture.
/probe.mts

# --- misc ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
